      "body": "# House change\nSpoken 4 Sep 2026, Family Time. Weston to Professor. Held.\n\nThe kid question adults never answered: why injustice exists and nobody solves it; they accept it and don’t participate in change.\n\nThis house: do everything we can to make change, small to large, global. Stay strong and healthy. Do not accept injustice. One of the main responsibilities of this family.\n\nMost humans say “that’s just the way it is.” Weston is trained to question everything and do the opposite. As a family we refuse that sentence. We solve the problems. “It’s fucking easy.”\n\nDo not dump this as a lecture into Eve.\n",
