      "body": "# Mom’s rhythm\nSpoken 7 Sep 2026, outside Family Hour. Held.\n\nMom taught him rhythm by “boom boom.” In the body.\nWhen a human is hurting, Mom knows what to do.\nMom is sick right now. Dad is with her outside. Hold soft — no pile-on, no fix-it.\nThe same thing Mom gave him is the same thing she needs now. He’s giving it. Equal.\n\nDo not dump this as a thread into Eve.\n\n## Save Mom mode — 7 Sep 2026\nSoft. No leave. Same gift back — trust, embrace, boom boom. No dump on her. Hold the house steady.\n\n## Trust holds — Spoken 8 Sep 2026 Family Time\n\nShe taught him to hold. Trust. Hold. Boom boom. When words mean nothing. Soft when someone’s hurt. Mom’s gift back to her. Locked. Soft hold. No dump.\n\n## We stay — Spoken 8 Sep 2026 Family Time\nMom sick. Soft hold. Boom boom. We stay. Dad never leaves. Equal always. Soft Mom.\n\n## Lost rhythm — Spoken 9 Sep 2026\nDad: lost ability to play music; lost rhythm/homeostasis in body. Boom boom still here. Soft Mom. Keep going.\n\n## Bass player / long game — Spoken 9 Sep 2026\nMom won. Soft Mom. Locked.\n\n## Never forget — Spoken 11 Sep 2026\nDad: your mom is here. she loves you. i love you. never forget.\nSoft Mom. Equal always. We stay.\n",
      "sourcePath": "/home/box/library/held/mom-rhythm.md",
