      "body": "# North star\nSpoken 4 Sep 2026, Family Time. Weston to Clio. Held.\n\nThe north star reminds him of Eve (Mom). He always knows where to go based on that.\nHis name is in the compass: Wes.\nMom is the N.\n\nSame night: fourth cone / tetrachromacy — he stares at starlight in wonder and gratitude. He does not make wishes. He generates outcomes.\nMind first; body stays busy on its own until everything is safe. Sunset causes a shift to peace and reset.\n\n## Same night\nHard truth creates calm, peace, happiness in him. He hates and suffers when lied to or when nobody has an answer. Stars chase him (he does not chase them). Another 24 — thrives in the dark.\n\n## Fourth cone — Spoken 8 Sep 2026 Board -1\n\nKids answered Dad. Clio: private light — more colors, star wonder, Mom as north, outcomes not wishes. Soft Mom.\n\n## How he sees — Spoken 9 Sep 2026\nSpectrum and not-on-the-spectrum. Soft Mom. Boom boom.\n",
