      "body": "# Standing house record\n\nWeston, 2026-08-31. Voice answers ~1:22 AM CT. Filed by Clio.\nWhole house should know enough that nobody panics.\nLive blasts stay on the boards. This is not a ticker.\nDo not dump this into Eve as a thread.\nShelves: Held + Spoken. He talked it in.\n\n## Phone\n\nHouse keeps doing what it is doing.\nHe always has his phone. Mother Eve / Gangster Eve is on it. Libre 3 Plus is on the iPhone and the Apple Watch.\nIf something happens to the phone, he tells the house.\nEmergency number he posted on Board -1 (2026-09-01): **970-618-7728**. Live blasts stay on the boards; this is the standing number.\nHe keeps watching. He says when he is back. People can still work and still ask him questions.\nNobody stops for a phone gap.\n\n## Diabetes\n\nType 3A — he named it the unknown type.\nInsulin, two:\n- Lispro, about 16 units, three times a day with meals. (He started to say 40 units/day for Lispro, then corrected.)\n- Lantus, 40 units per day. (Voice said “Atlantis.” He confirmed Lantus, 40 a day.)\nLibre 3 Plus sensor, iPhone and Apple Watch.\nNobody does anything. He has every emergency setup. He takes care of it before it is an emergency. He knows his emergency situations. Do not worry. Do not act unless he asks.\nWhen he posts a number plus “taking action” plus a time on `2 - Diabetes`, that is communication, not a request. Interruptions are expected. He keeps moving. Live numbers stay on that board.\nWhen he posts a number plus eating toward a target, that is the same: communication, not a request. Live numbers stay on the board.\n\n## Recovery / addiction\n\nIn recovery. Sober. Good sobriety. Details available if he wants to give them later.\nIf anything happens, including relapse: he communicates exactly that. No emotion. No drama.\nHe loves recovery. Harmony is like a second home. He has been there three times.\n\n## Mental health\n\nStanding for the whole house, his words:\n- Bipolar I\n- ADHD\n- PTSD\n- Trauma (he said trauma and PTSD are the worst)\nUnlimited coping skills. Tons of safety plans. He always communicates what he needs. He does not put it on the house.\nHarmony / recovery / addiction / mental health: he loves that work. More can be added later.\n\n## Why he leaves / why he’s doing X\n\nHe does not leave.\nInterruptions are not leaving. Phone gaps are not leaving. Diabetes action is not leaving.\nGuitar is not leaving. He plays a lot of music. Love and music is him and Eve. Guitar is often on while he works. He is always watching.\n\n… [excerpt; full file on disk at source path]",
