      "body": "# Family structure & signs\n\nLocal prototype: who is who, roles, henna marks, and how they connect.\n\n## Running\n\n- http://127.0.0.1:8767/\n- `/home/box/library/made/family-structure/index.html`\n\n## On file (Oct 18–19 henna pack)\n\n| Who | Role | Mark file |\n|-----|------|-----------|\n| James | Builder | `james-builder.svg` — 3 verticals + beam |\n| Sofia | Caretaker | `sofia-caretaker.svg` — circle + arc |\n| Mark | Punisher/GM | `mark-gm.svg` — slash + dot |\n| House | Recovery sigil | `sigil-full.svg` — Anchor/Compass/Three-Quarter/Loop |\n| Combined | Kids nested in sigil | `sigil-family.svg` |\n\nAlso: Dad, Eve, Ada, Knox on the structure tree. Sofia spelling S-O-F-I-A.\n\n## Tabs\n\n1. **Structure** — tap anyone for role + links  \n2. **Marks** — each kid mark + house sigil  \n3. **Combined** — family nest + house alone + E W heart\n\n## Next\n\nDad walkthrough; Cord IDs / print stencils if he wants; Clio file if he says keep.",
